  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - El Salvador (01-Jan-2017-31-Dec-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Salvador, HIV, Ministry of Health of the Republic of El Salvador (MOH)This program has the following goals: Reduce the prevalence of HIV in specific populations in El Salvador. The objectives of this program are: Contribute to the prevention of HIV-AIDS in populations most-at-risk of HIV through the provision of a comprehensive service package.  Provide comprehensive care to people with HIV in the various institutions that provide services to reduce morbidity and mortality.  Strengthen community systems that promote access by the most-at-risk populations to the various primary prevention services and early HIV care, using an approach that focuses on human rights and multi-sectoral participation</narrative>
  </description>
